        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Denzel Washington, David Hewlett\n- Roles: actor, director, producer, writer, voice actor\n- Works: Stargate SG-1, Stargate Atlantis, Stargate Universe\n- Characters: Dr. Rodney McKay\n\nFacts:\n- Denzel Washington was born on December 28, 1954, and he is an American actor, director, and producer.\n- David Hewlett was born on April 18, 1968, and he is an English-born Canadian actor, writer, director, and voice actor.\n- David Hewlett is best known for playing Dr. Rodney McKay on the Canadian-American science fiction television shows Stargate SG-1, Stargate Atlantis, and Stargate Universe.",
